1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:05,213
Meet Ravi, a fictional breakfast
cafe owner in Bengaluru.

2
00:00:05,213 --> 00:00:06,755
He knows his customers.

3
00:00:06,755 --> 00:00:09,511
His next business decision feels
less certain.

4
00:00:09,511 --> 00:00:11,596
Meet Udaan AI: a business companion

5
00:00:11,596 --> 00:00:15,202
designed to turn possibilities into
small, informed experiments.

6
00:00:15,202 --> 00:00:17,330
Starting with Ravi's business
context,

7
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:19,957
let's explore a Rs99 breakfast
combo.

8
00:00:19,957 --> 00:00:22,755
This prototype walkthrough uses Demo
Mode.

9
00:00:22,755 --> 00:00:24,957
At Rs45 variable cost,

10
00:00:24,957 --> 00:00:27,096
and Rs1,500 promotion,

11
00:00:27,096 --> 00:00:30,170
100 combos model Rs3,900
contribution

12
00:00:30,170 --> 00:00:32,787
after promotion, before other
overheads.

13
00:00:32,787 --> 00:00:36,989
Promotion breaks even at 28 combos
across the entire seven-day test.

14
00:00:36,989 --> 00:00:42,734
Ravi approves the experiment.

15
00:00:42,734 --> 00:00:46,085
Now, an illustrative result: 70
combos.

16
00:00:46,085 --> 00:00:49,681
That's Rs2,280 modeled contribution.

17
00:00:49,681 --> 00:00:51,574
Below target, but still positive.

18
00:00:51,574 --> 00:00:55,117
Udaan suggests a smaller local
visibility test:

19
00:00:55,117 --> 00:00:57,011
a hypothesis to explore,

20
00:00:57,011 --> 00:00:59,309
not proof of what caused the
shortfall.

21
00:00:59,309 --> 00:01:00,324
Discover.

22
00:01:00,324 --> 00:01:01,331
Explore.

23
00:01:01,331 --> 00:01:02,335
Evaluate.

24
00:01:02,335 --> 00:01:03,081
Try.

25
00:01:03,081 --> 00:01:03,931
Measure.

26
00:01:03,931 --> 00:01:04,805
Learn.

27
00:01:04,805 --> 00:01:05,862
Udaan AI.

28
00:01:05,862 --> 00:01:10,074
Every small business deserves a big
possibility.
